analysis_files

billboard.csv

analysis_cache
billboard: artist, track, date entered, and the first four week columns
```{r}
billboard |>
  dplyr::summarize(
    first_date = min(date.entered),
    last_date = max(date.entered)
  )
```

```{r}
n_values <- sum(!is.na(billboard$wk1))

billboard |>
  dplyr::filter(!is.na(wk1)) |>
  ggplot2::ggplot(ggplot2::aes(x = wk1)) +
  ggplot2::geom_histogram(binwidth = 1) +
  ggplot2::labs(
    x = "Week 1 ranking",
    y = "Number of songs",
    subtitle = paste("Values used:", n_values)
  )
```
summary(billboard$date.entered)
